 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2025-01-16",
   "text": "Natural Gas Tax Repeal Act\nThis bill eliminates a program administered by the Environmental Protection Agency that provides support for reducing methane emissions from the oil and gas sector. It also repeals a charge on methane emissions from facilities that contain petroleum and natural gas systems and emit 25,000 metric tons or more of greenhouse gases per year."
  }
